            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera ebyo, Esanduuku ey'Endagaano ya Katonda yabanga eyo e Betheli, era nga Finehasi mutabane wa Eleazari era mwidhukulu wa Aaroni, n'agirabirira. Abaisiraeli baabuuza Musengwa Katonda bati: “Twiremu kabiri okulwanisa baganda baife Ababenjamini, oba tubiveeku?” Musengwa Katonda yairamu ati: “Muje mulwane, kuba olwaidho ndidha kubagha Ababenjamini abo mubaghangule.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27+JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27",
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27+JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27",
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abaisiraeli baataagho abalwani, baabwama nga beeteeze agho ku kibuga Gibea okukyezunguluza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo baaniinaniina baaja okulwanisa Ababenjamini olunaku olwokusatu. Beetegeka mu nhiriri okulingiriza Gibea, bakirwanise ng'oti ni bwe baakola ku mikuzi gire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababenjamini baavaayo okulwana, baasendebwasendebwa okuva mu kibuga. Baakola ng'oti ni ku mikuzi egindi, baatoolera okukubira n'okwitira abandi ku Baisiraeli ku nguudo; ku lundi oluniinaniina e Betheli, ni ku lundi oluja e Gibea, era ni mu irungu. Baita Abaisiraeli ng'amakumi asatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababenjamini baakoba bati: “Tubaghangwire nga bwe twakola ku mikuzi egyasooka.” Aye Abaisiraeli baakoba bati: “Ka tulumuke tubasendesende bave mu kibuga, baire mu nguudo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Abaisiraeli boonaboona baasituka baava mu kifo kye baalimu, baaja beeteega mu nhiriri e Baalitamari. Olwo n'Abaisiraeli abaali babwaime nga beeteeze, baaziinhuuka mu kifo kye baalimu e bugwandhuba wa Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaadha omutwalo mulamba abaalondebwa n'obwegendereza mu Isiraeli yoonayoona, baalumba Gibea, era okulwana kwaba kwa maani inho. Aye Ababenjamini baali nga tibategeire ng'akabi kabali kumpi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaagha Isiraeli okughangula Ababenjamini ku lunaku olwo. Abaisiraeli baita abasaadha emitwalo ebiri n'enkumi itaanu na kikumi (25,100) ku balwani Ababenjamini. Abo baali abalwani beene abaziramu ntete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Ababenjamini baamanha nga baghangwirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekikunsu eky'abalwani Abaisiraeli kyalumuka Ababenjamini, kuba baali beesiga ekikunsu eky'abalwani Baisiraeli banaibwe abaabwama nga beeteeze okumpi ni Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalwani abo abaabwama baaziinhuuka embiro, baalumba Gibea, baita abaakirimu boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikunsu ebyo byombi byali bitairegho akamanhiso, biti ekikunsu eky'abalwani abo abaabwama bwe kinaaniosa omwosi omungi oguli ng'oti kire mu kibuga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olwo ekikunsu eky'abalwani abaali bali kulumuka nga kikyuka okulwanisa Ababenjamini. Olwo Ababenjamini baali bamaze okukuba n'okwita Abaisiraeli ng'amakumi asatu, nga baakoba bati: “Tubaghangwire nga bwe twakola ku mikuzi egyasooka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye akamanhiso kaaboneka, ekyo nga n'ekire eky'omwosi ekiri ng'oti mpango, ekyanioka okuva mu kibuga okutuuka ku igulu. Ababenjamini bwe baakyuka okulinga einhuma, baaja okubona ng'ekibuga kyonakyona kiri kuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abaisiraeli be baali bali kubingirira baakyuka, olwo Ababenjamini baadhugumira nga bali kubona akabi kabatuuseeku! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakyuka, balumukire mu ngira eja mu irungu, aye nga bazira ye baja! Agho baagemerwa ghagati gh'ekikunsu eky'Abaisiraeli abalwani abaali bali kulumuka n'ekikunsu eky'Abaisiraeli bale abaabwama, olwo baazikirizibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baazingiza Ababenjamini okubeezunguluza, baababingirira aghazira kugheera, okubatuusa mu kifo ekiri e buvandhuba wa Gibea, nga baja bwe babaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Babenjamini mwafaamu abalwani beene abaziramu ntete omutwalo mulala na kanaana (18,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi baakyuka, baalumuka nga baja mu irungu, nga boolekeire Olubaale lwa Rimmoni. Enkumi itaanu ku abo baitibwa ku nguudo. Abaisiraeli baayongera okubinga abasigairegho okutuuka e Gidoma, baabaitamu enkumi ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Ababenjamini boonaboona abaafa ku lunaku olwo, baaba emitwalo ebiri n'enkumi itaanu (25,000), boonaboona nga balwani beene abaziramu ntete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
